msgid "This is a simple tutorial on how to deploy and benchmark LMCache."
msgstr "这是一个关于如何部署和对 LMCache 进行基准测试的简单教程。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/benchmarking.rst:7
msgid "Workload Generator -- Long Doc QA:"
msgstr "负载生成器 -- 长文档问答："

#: ../../source/getting_started/benchmarking.rst:9
msgid ""
"Long Doc QA (found in ``benchmarks/long_doc_qa/``) is a highly flexible "
"traffic simulator that sends long context queries (\"documents\") to your"
" serving engine. Some configurable parameters include the number of "
"tokens in the documents (default is 10000), the number of documents to "
"send to the model (default is 20), the number of output tokens per "
"request (default is 100), and the cache hit/miss ratio (e.g. 2:2 means a "
"repeated 2 hit and 2 miss pattern through all the documents). You can "
"also choose the number of times to repeat prompts and the mode of "
"repetition (random, tile, interleave)."
msgstr "长文档问答（位于 ``benchmarks/long_doc_qa/``）是一个高度灵活的流量模拟器，可向您的服务引擎发送长上下文查询（\"文档\"）。一些可配置的参数包括：文档中的词元数（默认为 10000）、发送到模型的文档数量（默认为 20）、每个请求的输出词元数（默认为 100），以及缓存命中/未命中比率（例如 2:2 表示通过所有文档重复 2 次命中和 2 次未命中的模式）。您还可以选择重复提示词的次数以及重复模式（随机、平铺、交错）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/benchmarking.rst:13
msgid ""
"LMCache provides a simple Long Doc QA Recommender that helps you deploy "
"LMCache and generate the appropriate traffic through Long Doc QA. It will"
" also help you determine the tensor parallelism and the amount of CPU RAM"
" to deploy LMCache with based on the specifications of your hardware."
msgstr "LMCache 提供了一个简单的长文档问答推荐器，可帮助您部署 LMCache 并通过长文档问答生成适当的流量。它还将根据您的硬件规格帮助您确定张量并行度和部署 LMCache 所需的 CPU 内存量。"

